  {
    "hotel_id": "462907",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/princes-gardens_2/hotel/london-gb.html",
    "name": "Princes Gardens",
    "detail": "Me and a friend of mine wanted a cheap hotel that is located in central London, then I found this hotel. We just wanted our own room with personal WC, not a shared bathroom, like most of budget hotels in London. Upon arrival, we were shock how good located the hotel is and it's nice and peaceful surroundings. We felt safe (2 young women in their early 20's). We were really didn't care if they are not cleaning everyday, but during our stay they did room cleaning everyday. The hotel is more like a dormitory styled. You have the full responsibility to your room. Which we prefered. The area's are good too. Restaurants, tube (south kensington), bus stops, museums (science museum and victoria&albert museum), Albert Hall, Harrods and Harvey Niccols Mall are just minutes away. There's a church nearby too. And if you like to walk. Oxford st. is like 2 blocks away. A very easy access to everthing. Love this hotel and ganna stay here again.",
